## 14. Trace Continuity

A valid execution should preserve trace continuity.

Expected condition:

```text
trace_id(INPUT)
=
trace_id(VALIDATION)
=
trace_id(ANALYSIS)
=
trace_id(PATTERN)
=
trace_id(OUTPUT)
```

Where an action or integration event belongs to the same execution:

```text
trace_id(ACTION)
=
trace_id(INTEGRATION)
=
trace_id(OUTPUT)
```

Any unexplained trace break should be treated as an observability issue requiring investigation.

---

